# Reviewer availability. lfrPullsTriage reads this on every run.
# Copy to availability.local.yaml (gitignored).
#
# Each entry marks a reviewer as unavailable for a date range (inclusive).
# A date range "YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD" overlapping today excludes that
# reviewer from the assignment pool. A single date "YYYY-MM-DD" excludes
# for that day only.
#
# Example:
#
# - user: some-login
#   out: 2026-12-22..2027-01-05
#   reason: vacation
# - user: other-login
#   out: 2026-11-10
#   reason: offsite
#
# Keep entries sorted by start date for easy maintenance.

# (empty — add entries as reviewers go on PTO)
